   "since": "2026-09-01",
   "unit": null,
   "value": "The mission of the Administration for Strategic Preparedness and Response (ASPR) is to assist the country in preparing for, responding to, and recovering from public health emergencies and disasters. \r\n\r\nASPR accomplishes its mission in several ways, including: developing, stockpiling, and distributing response tools against multiple threats; sending clinical response teams to places in times of crisis; and ensuring its healthcare and public health partners have the knowledge and tools they need to navigate today's challenges and confront whatever challenges lay ahead.",
